WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.440
Tracker crews: tapping each guard's steps as they happen.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.451
Open the link the coordinators sent you. It shows which steps you can tap.

00:00:09.651 --> 00:00:11.940
Pick the guard in front of you.

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.247
Your steps are the dark buttons. Tap one when it happens.

00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:21.170
Grey ones belong to other crews. They fill in as those crews tap them.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:27.470
Done. It's on the live board right away. Wrong guard or wrong step? Tap Undo.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:33.830
Thanks, crew. Keep the tracker open between guards. It refreshes by itself.
